{
    "title": "Kisi",
    "description": "Kisi is a cloud-based door access control and security solution.  \r\n \r\nUNLOCK DOORS WITH YOUR PHONE\r\n \r\nWith the Kisi app, you can use your Android device to quickly and securely unlock any door equipped with Kisi. \r\n \r\n* See the list of the doors you have access to and unlock them from the app \r\n* Tap-to-unlock*: open a door by holding your Android device up to a Kisi Reader\r\n* Motion Sense**: unlock your door with a simple wave of your hand, without the need to actively use your mobile device\r\n* Intercoms***: communicate with your visitors in a video format with the help of your smartphone\r\n* Wear OS: access doors you have access to from your wrist\r\n* One single key for any door, in any building\r\n \r\n*requires NFC access. Some doors might require access to your location to be unlocked.\r\n**requires Bluetooth and Foreground Service permissions.\r\n***requires Foreground Service permissions. \r\n\r\nMANAGE ACCESS TO ANYONE WITH ONE TOUCH \r\n \r\nAs a Kisi admin, you can use the Kisi app to quickly and securely manage access to your facilities. \r\n \r\n* Grant or revoke access to anyone with one touch\r\n* Send access links to temporary staff and visitors \r\n* See user activity at a given place for a given date \r\n* Set scheduled unlocks \r\n* Receive relevant security-related notifications",
    "descriptionHTML": "Kisi is a cloud-based door access control and security solution.  <br> <br>UNLOCK DOORS WITH YOUR PHONE<br> <br>With the Kisi app, you can use your Android device to quickly and securely unlock any door equipped with Kisi. <br> <br>* See the list of the doors you have access to and unlock them from the app <br>* Tap-to-unlock*: open a door by holding your Android device up to a Kisi Reader<br>* Motion Sense**: unlock your door with a simple wave of your hand, without the need to actively use your mobile device<br>* Intercoms***: communicate with your visitors in a video format with the help of your smartphone<br>* Wear OS: access doors you have access to from your wrist<br>* One single key for any door, in any building<br> <br>*requires NFC access. Some doors might require access to your location to be unlocked.<br>**requires Bluetooth and Foreground Service permissions.<br>***requires Foreground Service permissions. <br><br>MANAGE ACCESS TO ANYONE WITH ONE TOUCH <br> <br>As a Kisi admin, you can use the Kisi app to quickly and securely manage access to your facilities. <br> <br>* Grant or revoke access to anyone with one touch<br>* Send access links to temporary staff and visitors <br>* See user activity at a given place for a given date <br>* Set scheduled unlocks <br>* Receive relevant security-related notifications",
